":"thm-omega-stable-saturated-models — Saturated Models of ω-Stable Theories"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c973042c939008f\" href=\"?note=6c973042c939008f\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-saturation\">17-df-cardinal-saturation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0626faf5263e31f8\" href=\"?note=0626faf5263e31f8\" title=\"17-df-omega-stability\">17-df-omega-stability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-8.3.1b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 为候选集合。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span> (model class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa\">\\(\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-saturation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6c973042c939008f\" href=\"?note=6c973042c939008f\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-saturation\">17-df-cardinal-saturation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OmegaStable}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{OmegaStable}_L\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-stability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0626faf5263e31f8\" href=\"?note=0626faf5263e31f8\" title=\"17-df-omega-stability\">17-df-omega-stability</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,|\\cdot|,\\aleph_0\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,|\\cdot|,\\aleph_0\\)</span> (cardinality notions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;\\operatorname{OmegaStable}_L(T)\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\\bigl(\\aleph_0\\leq\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak A|\\,\\bigr|\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak M|\\,\\bigr|=\\kappa\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak M)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;\\operatorname{OmegaStable}_L(T)\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\\bigl(\\aleph_0\\leq\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak A|\\,\\bigr|\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak M|\\,\\bigr|=\\kappa\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak M)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A countable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-stable theory with infinite models has a saturated model in every infinite cardinal. The infinite-model premise excludes complete theories of a fixed finite structure. This statement is distinct from Vaught's two-cardinal theorem and no longer uses that incorrect title.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-saturation","status":"resolved","id":"6c973042c939008f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-omega-stability","status":"resolved","id":"0626faf5263e31f8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-omega-stability]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ (model class, see [[17-df-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"1